 "finding": "Across 20 seeds the trained ensemble's episode count per 40 s run runs from 1 to 103, median 1. 13 of 20 seeds have it on continuously and 1 of 20 fall inside the 0.5 to 1.5 Hz band measured in a sleeping fly. So the episodic behaviour is real in the seeds that show it and it is NOT the typical behaviour of this configuration: a three-seed look suggested otherwise and was wrong. Reported because the difference between one seed in twenty and a phenomenon is the whole question.",
